    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "This document provides the formal clean-room evidence report of the data ingestion and export subsystem `crates/statcraft_io` (SPSS `.sav`/`.zsav`, Excel `.xlsx`/`.xls`/`.ods`, CSV/TSV RFC 4180, and StatCraft `.stc` container) across real-world datasets, synthetically generated edge cases, and malformed fuzzing streams."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793980823728326200",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "The audit was conducted using the **Craft Anything MCP** in clean-room mode (`clean-room: true`), evaluating conformance against the *GNU PSPP System File Format Specification*, *RFC 4180*, and the *ArtCraft Never Crash Invariant*."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793980823728327200",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "---"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793980823728327800",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "1. Audit Matrix & Findings (Microplans C-01 — C-05)"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1793980823728328400",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "| Microplan | Subsystem / Target | Target Invariant | Finding & Verification Status |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **C-01** | SPSS `.sav` / `.zsav` Bytecode Stream | Full opcode matrix (0..255), ZLIB block decompression | **RESOLVED (BUG-003):** Fixed opcode 254 decoding to numeric `0.0` (previously decoded to `Null`). Verified opcode 255 as `SYSMIS`, bias subtraction for codes 1..251, literal 253, and EOF 252. Decompressed `.zsav` blocks via zheader/ztrailer offsets. |\n| **C-02** | SPSS Extended Record 7 & Encodings | Record 7 subtypes 3, 11, 14, 20; CP1251 transcoding | **RESOLVED (BUG-004):** Corrected Record 7 subtype matching to canonical Subtype 11 for variable display parameters (measurement level, column width, alignment). Implemented Subtype 14 for Very Long Strings ($> 255$ bytes) across continuation slots. Added zero-dependency safe transcoders in `encoding.rs` for Windows-1251 (Cyrillic), Windows-1252, and KOI8-R. |\n| **C-03** | Excel Worksheets Ingestion (`.xlsx`, `.xls`, `.ods`) | Dirty columns casting, formula error cells, extreme dates | **VERIFIED:** Mixed columns with numbers and text safely cast to `RawDataType::Text`. Formula error cells (`#VALUE!`, `#REF!`, `#DIV/0!`, `#N/A`, `#NAME?`) and missing markers (`\"-\"`, `\"none\"`, `\"NA\"`) map to `RawValue::Null`. Column headers sanitized and deduplicated per SPSS rules. |\n| **C-04** | CSV / TSV Ingestion & Export | RFC 4180 multiline, quote escapes, BOM, roundtrip | **VERIFIED:** Multiline quoted fields (`\"line 1\\nline 2\"`) and escaped quotes (`\"\"`) preserved. Automatic delimiter detection (`,`, `;`, `\\t`, `|`). Stripping of UTF-8 BOM (`\\u{FEFF}`) from headers. Mathematical roundtrip invariant $\\text{RawTable} \\equiv \\text{reload}(\\text{export}(\\text{RawTable}))$ verified. |\n| **C-05** | Malformed Input Fuzzing & Corpus Runner | Never Crash invariant: 0 panics on corrupted inputs | **VERIFIED:** Implemented `cargo xtask test-corpus` runner and malformed fuzzing suite (11 fuzzed probe streams: truncated headers, bad magic, negative bias, corrupt gzip, invalid json). 100% of malformed inputs safely return typed `Err(IoError)` with 0 panics. |"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793980823728330200",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "---"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793980823728330800",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "2. Automated Corpus Execution Results (`cargo xtask test-corpus`)"
