      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "3. Registered Bugs & Defect Corrections"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1793980823728339300",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "- **BUG-003:** In compressed SPSS `.sav` files, opcode 254 was decoded as `None` (Null) instead of `Some(0.0)`. Corrected in `crates/statcraft_io/src/spss_loader/decompress.rs`.\n- **BUG-004:** In Record Type 7, Variable Display Parameters were erroneously matched on subtype 4 instead of canonical subtype 11. Corrected in `crates/statcraft_io/src/spss_loader/records.rs` with full support for Subtype 11, Subtype 14 (Very Long Strings), Subtype 3 (codepage), and Subtype 20 (encoding)."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793980823728340400",
