<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="generator" content="CapsuleCraft Native"></head><body style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;max-width:720px;margin:32px auto;line-height:1.55;color:#23201c;background:#faf8f4;"><h1>📚 StatCraft / StatCraft — Real-World Corpora &amp; Codecs Audit Report (Phase 4 / Codecs Audit)</h1><p><em>[callout block — open in CapsuleCraft web for its canvas]</em></p><h1>StatCraft — Real-World Corpora &amp; Codecs Audit Report (Phase 4 / Codecs Audit)</h1><h2>Executive Summary</h2><p>This document provides the formal clean-room evidence report of the data ingestion and export subsystem `crates/statcraft_io` (SPSS `.sav`/`.zsav`, Excel `.xlsx`/`.xls`/`.ods`, CSV/TSV RFC 4180, and StatCraft `.stc` container) across real-world datasets, synthetically generated edge cases, and malformed fuzzing streams.</p><p>The audit was conducted using the **Craft Anything MCP** in clean-room mode (`clean-room: true`), evaluating conformance against the *GNU PSPP System File Format Specification*, *RFC 4180*, and the *ArtCraft Never Crash Invariant*.</p><p>---</p><h2>1. Audit Matrix &amp; Findings (Microplans C-01 — C-05)</h2><p>| Microplan | Subsystem / Target | Target Invariant | Finding &amp; Verification Status |<br>|---|---|---|---|<br>| **C-01** | SPSS `.sav` / `.zsav` Bytecode Stream | Full opcode matrix (0..255), ZLIB block decompression | **RESOLVED (BUG-003):** Fixed opcode 254 decoding to numeric `0.0` (previously decoded to `Null`). Verified opcode 255 as `SYSMIS`, bias subtraction for codes 1..251, literal 253, and EOF 252. Decompressed `.zsav` blocks via zheader/ztrailer offsets. |<br>| **C-02** | SPSS Extended Record 7 &amp; Encodings | Record 7 subtypes 3, 11, 14, 20; CP1251 transcoding | **RESOLVED (BUG-004):** Corrected Record 7 subtype matching to canonical Subtype 11 for variable display parameters (measurement level, column width, alignment). Implemented Subtype 14 for Very Long Strings ($&gt; 255$ bytes) across continuation slots. Added zero-dependency safe transcoders in `encoding.rs` for Windows-1251 (Cyrillic), Windows-1252, and KOI8-R. |<br>| **C-03** | Excel Worksheets Ingestion (`.xlsx`, `.xls`, `.ods`) | Dirty columns casting, formula error cells, extreme dates | **VERIFIED:** Mixed columns with numbers and text safely cast to `RawDataType::Text`. Formula error cells (`#VALUE!`, `#REF!`, `#DIV/0!`, `#N/A`, `#NAME?`) and missing markers (`&quot;-&quot;`, `&quot;none&quot;`, `&quot;NA&quot;`) map to `RawValue::Null`. Column headers sanitized and deduplicated per SPSS rules. |<br>| **C-04** | CSV / TSV Ingestion &amp; Export | RFC 4180 multiline, quote escapes, BOM, roundtrip | **VERIFIED:** Multiline quoted fields (`&quot;line 1\nline 2&quot;`) and escaped quotes (`&quot;&quot;`) preserved. Automatic delimiter detection (`,`, `;`, `\t`, `|`). Stripping of UTF-8 BOM (`\u{FEFF}`) from headers. Mathematical roundtrip invariant $\text{RawTable} \equiv \text{reload}(\text{export}(\text{RawTable}))$ verified. |<br>| **C-05** | Malformed Input Fuzzing &amp; Corpus Runner | Never Crash invariant: 0 panics on corrupted inputs | **VERIFIED:** Implemented `cargo xtask test-corpus` runner and malformed fuzzing suite (11 fuzzed probe streams: truncated headers, bad magic, negative bias, corrupt gzip, invalid json). 100% of malformed inputs safely return typed `Err(IoError)` with 0 panics. |</p><p>---</p><h2>2. Automated Corpus Execution Results (`cargo xtask test-corpus`)</h2><p>The automated corpus runner executed against `fixtures/corpus/` and `test_data/`:</p><p><em>[code block — open in CapsuleCraft web for its canvas]</em></p><p>---</p><h2>3. Registered Bugs &amp; Defect Corrections</h2><p>- **BUG-003:** In compressed SPSS `.sav` files, opcode 254 was decoded as `None` (Null) instead of `Some(0.0)`. Corrected in `crates/statcraft_io/src/spss_loader/decompress.rs`.<br>- **BUG-004:** In Record Type 7, Variable Display Parameters were erroneously matched on subtype 4 instead of canonical subtype 11. Corrected in `crates/statcraft_io/src/spss_loader/records.rs` with full support for Subtype 11, Subtype 14 (Very Long Strings), Subtype 3 (codepage), and Subtype 20 (encoding).</p><p>---</p><h2>4. Definition of Done (DoD) Verification</h2><p>1. `cargo test --workspace -j 1` — 100% tests passed, 0 failed.<br>2. `cargo fmt --all -- --check` — Clean formatting across all crates.<br>3. `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -j 1 -- -D warnings` — Clean, zero warnings.<br>4. `cargo run -p xtask -j 1 -- layers` — Strictly adheres to L0-L6 layering.<br>5. `cargo run -p xtask -j 1 -- file-guard` — All 269 files within size limits.<br>6. `cargo run -p xtask -j 1 -- design-guard` — 100% DialogKit compliance.<br>7. `cargo run -p xtask -j 1 -- test-corpus` — 100% passed, 0 panics.<br>8. `cargo run -p xtask -j 1 -- ci` — Full CI quality gate passed.</p><hr><p style="color:#8a8175;font-size:12px">Exported from CapsuleCraft Native · &lt;doc-statcraft-docs_corpus_audit_report_md@capsuleos.local&gt;</p></body></html>

